## Credential references (names only, never values)
- IC read-only token: `op://<vault>/<item>/<field>`
- Market data key (Massive): `op://Automation/Investing Companion - Secrets/MASSIVE_API_KEY`
  Copy `.env.example` to `.env` (gitignored) and start Claude Code through the resolver so the key
  reaches the `massive` MCP server as `MASSIVE_API_KEY`; the resolver never prints the secret:
  `~/.claude/scripts/op-resolve.py --env-file .env -- claude`
  One-time setup: `uv tool install "mcp_massive @ git+https://github.com/massive-com/mcp_massive@v0.10.0"`
  and `cp .mcp.json.example .mcp.json`

